WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.410 align:start position:0%
 
really  [Music]  age awareness 3 is at its best when  you're locked in glorious battle from  flanking bonuses and line of sight to  magical research in the industrial  infrastructure of your empire every  detail in this turn-based strategy game  contributes towards making the  battlefield as complex and rewarding as  possible outside of combat the game's  managerial aspects are kept to a minimum  which keeps age of Wonders 3 moving at a  fast clip and frees you up to focus your  attention on the action each game of age  wanders 3 begins with you taking up the  mantle of a mighty hero such as an elven  sorcerer dwarven theocrats and guiding  your people through conflict to  prosperity before you can get in  conflict however you're going to need  cities to produce your army cities are  the backbone of your empire as well as  one of the game's main objectives  victory an age of Wonders 3 means  protecting your capital city while  defeating the enemies hero and capturing  his or her capital cities are largely  self-sufficient requiring little more  than your input on which buildings to  build your recommendations determine  which units the city can produce and  whether those units come with free  upgrades from specialized structures  once your army is on the field it's time  to explore your kingdom each of the  game's procedurally generated Maps comes  packed with treasure sites such as caves  or abandoned temples for you to stumble  upon these sites are usually protected  by packs of bandits or monsters both of  which are great for testing your newly  minted army upon before challenging one  of the game's main players  regardless of who or what you're  fighting your army is always gaining  experience and leveling up basic units  such as archers and Knights earn flat  bonuses to their stats as they move up  and rank while your hero units earn  skill points used to either increase  their stats or unlock special abilities  when you feel your army is ready or are  caught by a surprise attack it's time to  wage war when you engage another army in  battle you are transported to a more  intimate arena that's separate from the  world map the fighting takes place on a  hexed base grid which could contain  trees or boulders or even city walls in  the case of urban assaults using the  terrain your skills and every other tool  that your disposal is paramount to  victory rushing headlong into the fight  only gets you slaughtered woven between  the combat and empire building is the  research tree where you research new  spells and technologies for your people  it's one of your most powerful assets  but also one of the most unpredictable  as most of the trees randomized at the  start of the game depending on which  research options you have available your  strategy throughout the first half of a  match could vary wildly regardless of  the class or race you choose to lead  your rise to glory will likely begin in  one of the game's offline modes two  campaigns serve as a good introduction  to the game's mechanics as well as its  mythos while the scenario and randomize  map modes are great for just wailing on  the AI  [Music]  when you're ready to take the fight  online however you may experience some  hiccups on two different machines I  encountered connection errors with the  developer servers which prompted me to  seek aid through the developers website  and should you find yourself in a  similar circumstance and art already  well-versed in firewall port forwarding  you may find the developer solutions  woefully under developed online foibles  aside age wonders 3 is still a  well-crafted strategy game that doesn't  let itself get bogged down and needless  busy work some smart elements of  randomness help keep you on your toes  after multiple sessions though you may  find several go-to strategies still  apply regardless of the sort of army you  lead age of Wonders 3 is the welcome  return of a long absent strategy series  and a tactically rewarding game  [Applause]  [Music]

